{"repositoryId":1298338475,"availability":"available","full":"LiriothTeltanion/NovaMusicLab","name":"NovaMusicLab","description":"Local-first React + TypeScript music museum for private listening-history imports, Living Artist Atlas and genre discovery, evidence-aware visual analytics, and accessible EN/ES/HE RTL UX.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-12T14:13:46Z","updated":"2026-10-18T16:33:35Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://liriothteltanion.github.io/NovaMusicLab/","topics":["accessibility","data-visualization","frontend-development","indexeddb","internationalization","lastfm","listenbrainz","local-first","music-analytics","music-discovery","musicbee","playwright","privacy-first","pwa","react","rtl","spotify","typescript","vite","vitest"],"demo":"https://liriothteltanion.github.io/NovaMusicLab/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:44:50.207Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T22:44:50.207Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T22:44:50.207Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T22:44:50.207Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( []( []( [](#-privacy-and-network-boundary) [](#-language-themes-and-accessibility)","Streaming platforms usually reduce years of listening to a short recap. Nova Music Lab begins with Kevin / Lirioth's published personal archive and treats it as a cultural artifact: something to investigate, revisit and interpret. The same browser experience lets another listener choose supported exports and build a private local museum without surrendering the raw history to a Nova analytics backend.","The project is built around five commitments:"],"features":["Evidence before spectacle. Unknown information remains unknown; estimates and interpretations must be distinguishable from observed facts.","Local-first ownership. Visitor-selected archives are parsed and stored in the browser.","Source awareness. Each provider exposes different fields, so rooms only claim capabilities their active archive can support.","A museum, not a spreadsheet. Motion, sound-inspired art, narrative and exploration make the evidence emotionally legible.","Reflection, not diagnosis. Emotional and personality language is an evidence-aware creative interpretation; it does not assess mental health or replace professional care."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LiriothTeltanion/NovaMusicLab/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ce1bf2676b9112fec85f0c889433a898684a1afe717fe8270da083720fc767f7","extractedAt":"2026-10-18T22:44:50.283Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:44:50.283Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[]( []( []( [](#-privacy-and-network-boundary) [](#-language-themes-and-accessibility)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LiriothTeltanion/NovaMusicLab/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"No account is required for the public exhibition or local archive import.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LiriothTeltanion/NovaMusicLab/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"A museum your friends can make their own — no account is required to name a local museum, import compatible files and begin a private comparison.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LiriothTeltanion/NovaMusicLab/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"ce1bf2676b9112fec85f0c889433a898684a1afe717fe8270da083720fc767f7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LiriothTeltanion/NovaMusicLab/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T22:44:50.284Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-18T16:33:35Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LiriothTeltanion/NovaMusicLab/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T22:44:50.285Z","hash":"ce1bf2676b9112fec85f0c889433a898684a1afe717fe8270da083720fc767f7","originalBytes":32605,"storedBytes":32605,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:4